<figure class="method-principle-figure"><svg viewBox="0 0 960 240" role="img" aria-labelledby="hifi-figure-title hifi-figure-desc"><title id="hifi-figure-title">从 HiFi 读段到相位感知组装图与候选路径</title><desc id="hifi-figure-desc">四阶段教学示意：重叠读段、重叠连接、带有分支的组装图、两条候选路径。分支可有多种来源；相位完整性取决于数据和运行模式。</desc><g font-family="Inter,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#104a36"><g fill="#ecf7ef"><rect x="30" y="14" width="148" height="30" rx="15"/><rect x="265" y="14" width="148" height="30" rx="15"/><rect x="502" y="14" width="160" height="30" rx="15"/><rect x="752" y="14" width="177" height="30" rx="15"/></g><g text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700"><text x="104" y="34">① HiFi reads</text><text x="339" y="34">② Overlaps</text><text x="582" y="34">③ Assembly graph</text><text x="840" y="34">④ Candidate paths</text></g><g stroke="#0e6548" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M25 82h80m-42 19h90m-44 19h83m-167 19h90m-35 19h78"/><path d="M264 87h79m-35 25h82m-125 26h80"/><path d="M512 120h34l34-33h56l37 33h27M546 120l34 34h56l37-34"/><path d="M769 99h154"/><path d="M769 146h154" stroke="#80b52c"/><path d="M216 120h22m-7-6 7 6-7 6M453 120h22m-7-6 7 6-7 6M722 120h22m-7-6 7 6-7 6"/></g><g fill="#b8d99c" stroke="#0e6548"><rect x="279" y="81" width="32" height="12"/><rect x="320" y="106" width="34" height="12"/><rect x="280" y="132" width="32" height="12"/><rect x="589" y="77" width="29" height="21" rx="4"/><rect x="589" y="143" width="29" height="21" rx="4" fill="#d6e9a5"/></g><g stroke="#0e6548" stroke-width="2.6" fill="white"><circle cx="512" cy="120" r="7"/><circle cx="700" cy="120" r="7"/>{[781,825,869,913].map(x=><circle cx={x} cy="99" r="7"/>)}{[781,825,869,913].map(x=><circle cx={x} cy="146" r="7" stroke="#80b52c"/>)}</g><g font-size="12"><text x="598" y="92">A</text><text x="598" y="158">B</text></g><g text-anchor="middle" font-size="13"><text x="104" y="193">高准确度长读段</text><text x="104" y="214">共享序列与候选差异</text><text x="339" y="193">识别可靠重叠</text><text x="339" y="214">重叠连接支持图构建</text><text x="603" y="193">保留并分析分支</text><text x="603" y="214">重复、等位差异或噪声</text><text x="840" y="193">图中路径与组装输出</text><text x="840" y="214">依模式与相位证据解释</text></g></g></svg><figcaption>教学示意，非真实测序数据。分支不都代表杂合等位变异；两条候选路径不表示已获得全染色体完全分相。HiFi-only 的 hap1/hap2 为部分相位 contig 图，具体输出依模式与版本而定。<a href="https://hifiasm.readthedocs.io/en/latest/interpreting-output.html">官方输出说明</a></figcaption></figure>
